Gerrit Pape wrote:
> Hi, please see below.  It doesn't seem to be a problem on other archs,
> so I guess it's not a bug in the packaging.  Do you know what went wrong
> here, and whether a rebuild would fix it?

It is not specific to alpha, it will be the same for mips and mipsel as
all of them use -rsudo. So it is definitely a packaging problem in that
you can't rely on it to be built as root user. Rebuilding won't help
here. You can easily reproduce this by building as non-root user and
using -rsudo in the invocation of dpkg-buildpackage.

Cheers

Luk



